{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10532","headline":"同熊少府题卢主簿茅斋 · 高适","name":"同熊少府题卢主簿茅斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虚院野情在，茅斋秋兴存。\n孝廉趋下位，才子出高门。\n乃继幽人静，能令学者尊。\n江山归谢客，神鬼下刘根。\n阶树时攀折，窗书任讨论。\n自堪成独往，何必武陵源。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10532.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10532","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}